{"id":"473482969","kind":"article","title":"14 2014：SM-17 算法","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/History_of_spaced_repetition_(print)#2014:_Algorithm_SM-17"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复的历史","date":"2022-02-28","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":17,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":1093,"keywords":["SuperMemo","SM-17","间隔重复","记忆模型","遗忘曲线","算法发展"],"summary":"作者把 SM-17 放在间隔重复算法演进史中，借反事实历史说明：从估算最优间隔、区分难度、绘制遗忘曲线，到指数遗忘、双组分记忆模型、稳定性增长函数和自适应数据，各项理论与技术逐步汇合，构成算法发展的关键链条。文章强调这是作者对算法演化的重述，也指出间隔重复仍需持续创新。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/473482969","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"GhG-ZR-K\">最新的 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a> 算法，可基于它的设计，用来总结自己的系统发展史。它也可以用来编写<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复</a>的反事实历史。如果没有恐龙，人类可能不会出现，或者可能会有不同的外观。然而，即便进化树上恐龙一脉全部消失，人类在哺乳动物这一脉上的演化并不受太大影响。</p><p data-pid=\"YMNJA0Ae\">以类似的方式，我们可以在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Algorithm_SM-17\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">算法 SM-17</a> 的出现中展示一个看似决定性的关联事件链。这可以用来证明 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Biedalak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Biedalak</a> 或 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Murakowski\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Murakowski</a> 对<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复</a>的历史比 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Ebbinghaus\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ebbinghaus</a> 更重要。Anki 比 Pimsleur 更重要。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Gary_Wolf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gary Wolf</a> 比 William James 的影响更大。</p><p data-pid=\"2VEfyRRb\">尽管如此，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复</a>的影响力尚未达到顶峰，仍处于早期阶段，且受到各种外力的左右。具体而言，不容小觑的竞争对手层出不穷，唯有锐意创新，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a> 才能维持它在间隔重复的核心地位（比如<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Neural_creativity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">神经创造力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>）</p><p data-pid=\"riL5Pace\">以下是我如何使用为这篇文章所写的历史构件来解释整个<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Algorithm_SM-17\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">算法 SM-17</a>：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"igJdQUgX\"> 长期保留的关键是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/The_birthday_of_spaced_repetition:_July_31,_1985\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">计算最优间隔</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup> (1985)<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"NOGIFu_R\"> 由于间隔取决于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Memory_complexity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆复杂性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>，我们首先需要将<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Item\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">项目</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>分为不同<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo_1.0_for_DOS_(1987)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">难度</a>类别 (1987)<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"aaVMZ_W_\"> 我们通过<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Employing_forgetting_curves_in_spaced_repetition_(1991)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">绘制遗忘曲线</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>找到最优复习时间，并找出<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Retention\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">保留率</a>下降到可接受水平以下(1991)的时刻<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"38-dw9I6\"> 为了在稀疏的数据中找到最优时间，我们需要使用近似手段，有助于得出<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Exponential_nature_of_forgetting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">遗忘的指数性质</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup> (1994)<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"DfXeG6HG\"> 由于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Forgetting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">遗忘</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>的速度取决于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Memory_stability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆稳定性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup>，整个算法的设计必须以<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Two_components_of_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">双组份记忆模型</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-10\"><a href=\"#ref-10\">[10]</a></sup>为核心（1988）。缺乏对这一模型的考虑可能是竞争性<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复</a>算法的开发者所犯的主要错误，例如一个利用<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Neural_networks_in_spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">神经网络方法</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-11\"><a href=\"#ref-11\">[11]</a></sup>的间隔重复算法（1997）<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"L6AbzunV\"> 双组分模型的关键力量是使<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo_Algorithm:_30-year-long_labor\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">计算复习时的记忆稳定性增长</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-12\"><a href=\"#ref-12\">[12]</a></sup> (2005) 成为可能<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"nBsXj5m0\"> 该算法必须通过收集重复的数据来建立记忆模型。它必须能够<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/First_adaptable_spaced_repetition_algorithm:_Algorithm_SM-4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">适应现有信息</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-13\"><a href=\"#ref-13\">[13]</a></sup> (1989)<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"BEEleZN4\"> 在有数据之前，从<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Search_for_a_universal_memory_formula\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">通用记忆公式</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-14\"><a href=\"#ref-14\">[14]</a></sup>开始是有帮助的（1990）<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"uZQ2Tzo7\"> 更多小调整和改进可以带来<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/First_data-driven_spaced_repetition_algorithm:_Algorithm_SM-8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天壤之别</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-15\"><a href=\"#ref-15\">[15]</a></sup>（1995），例如，遗忘后间隔、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/A-Factor\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">绝对难度</a>、快速多维回归，等等。<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"TwuxT5AZ\"> 需要实现<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Universal_metric\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">通用度量</a>以在未来算法中微调优化参数（2018）<br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"d_KwXNXX\">就这样，一步一步，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Algorithm_SM-17\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">算法 SM-17</a> 傲然矗立于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复</a>的进化树顶端。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"hlmSEhuk\">总目录：<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/375379522\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0 目录《间隔重复的历史》</a></p><p data-pid=\"LCfxMU3O\">上一章：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"471760789\" href=\"#/post/471760789\">13 2005：稳定性增长函数</a></p><p data-pid=\"_AxRqaLV\">下一章：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"473666349\" href=\"#/post/473666349\">15 间隔重复的指数式普及</a></p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"nQVMrEOt\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/History_of_spaced_repetition_(print)#2014:_Algorithm_SM-17\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2014: Algorithm SM-17</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔重复 (spaced repetition) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"305651556\" href=\"#/post/305651556\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 神经创造力 <a href=\"https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/neural_creativity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/neural_creativity</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 1985：SuperMemo 的诞生 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"95111167\" href=\"#/post/95111167\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 记忆复杂性 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"304800091\" href=\"#/post/304800091\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 条目 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"571700330\" href=\"#/post/571700330\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 1991：启用遗忘曲线 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"441532847\" href=\"#/post/441532847\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 1994：遗忘的指数性质 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"445497724\" href=\"#/post/445497724\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 遗忘 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"558542113\" href=\"#/post/558542113\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-9\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-9\">↩</a> 记忆稳定性 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"559298549\" href=\"#/post/559298549\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-10\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-10\">↩</a> 1988：记忆的两个组成成分 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"99505568\" href=\"#/post/99505568\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-11\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-11\">↩</a> 1997：启用神经网络 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"456205621\" href=\"#/post/456205621\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-12\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-12\">↩</a> 2005：稳定性增长函数 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"471760789\" href=\"#/post/471760789\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-13\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-13\">↩</a> 1989：SuperMemo 适应用户记忆 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"205600711\" href=\"#/post/205600711\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-14\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-14\">↩</a> 1990：记忆的通用公式 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"429504395\" href=\"#/post/429504395\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-15\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-15\">↩</a> 1995：超媒体 SuperMemo <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"447640544\" href=\"#/post/447640544\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"471760789","title":"13 2005：稳定性增长函数","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":12,"minutes":31,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复的历史"},{"id":"473666349","title":"15 间隔重复的指数式普及","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":18,"minutes":10,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复的历史"},{"id":"95111167","title":"02 1985：SuperMemo 的诞生","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":66,"minutes":17,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"99505568","title":"05 1988：记忆的两个组成成分","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":49,"minutes":20,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"205600711","title":"06 1989: SuperMemo 适应用户记忆(上)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":17,"minutes":8,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"279166945","title":"间隔效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「间隔重复」· Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「遗忘曲线」· Osmosis from Elsevier"},{"id":"1941069300833190267","title":"感知内容的间隔重复","author":"Giacomo Randazzo","votes":62,"minutes":21,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「间隔重复」· Giacomo Randazzo"}],"rec_answers":[]}